  "summary": "A Pokémon-like adventure in the terminal: catch Poketes, train them and battle other trainers.",
  "description": "Walk with the pad, OK talks and confirms, Back cancels. In battle 1-4 pick an attack; on the map 1 opens your deck, 3 the map, 4 the inventory, 5 the Pokedex. Menu has settings and saving. Version 0.9.2 without music (the player is a desktop library) and without trading over the network (Tuikio games are offline).",
